💫 Option 1 — Emotional but cleaner

You're a bum, you're a punk
You're a lost dream gone sunk
Lying there, nearly gone, on that bed all alone

You fool and you liar, you faded old fighter
Happy Christmas, my friend — may we start fresh again

🎭 Option 2 — Still gritty, but PG-13

You're a mess, you're a wreck
You're a soul out of step
Lying there half-awake, with a tear on your cheek

You heartbreak, you hazard, you poor ragged poet
Happy Christmas, my dear — hope we make it next year

🌃 Option 3 — Bittersweet and wistful

You're a ghost, you're a flame
You're a spark with no name
Lying there with your dreams fading out in the gray

You dreamer, you drifter, you lost city singer
Happy Christmas, my love — may we find what we’ve lost

🎶 Version 1 – Gritty but clean

